        /// <summary>
        /// Browse and search live market orders
        /// </summary>
        /// <remarks>
        /// Returns live market orders (buy and/or sell) visible from the character's current system, within their trade-network range. Supports filtering by view, item type, sub-type, free-text search, and evolution, plus ordering.
        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>The response is a superset shape: common fields are always present, and per-type nested detail (`properties`, `resourcesRequired`, `blueprintProperties`) plus extra scalars (`healthPercentage`, `evolution`, `subTypeId`, etc.) are present only for the item types that carry them.
        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>All market data is scoped to the character's **current system** and their trade-network reach — the API never accepts a location. Move the character in-game to query a different system.
        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>**Required scope:** `market.listings.read`
        /// </remarks>
        /// <param name="x_App_Id">The `app_id` GUID of the calling third-party application. Must match the `app_id` claim of the bearer token — a mismatch returns 401 Unauthorized.</param>
        /// <param name="view">Which side of the book to return: `Buy`, `Sell`, or `All`.</param>
        /// <param name="range">Search radius in JAS from the character's current system. Clamped server-side to the trade-network maximum (base 150 JAS + 10 per skill level).</param>
        /// <param name="search">Free-text search across item/location names. Join multiple terms with `||` to require all of them. Maximum 500 characters.</param>
        /// <param name="type">Item type-code to filter to (e.g. `R`, `S`, `Bp`, `Si`). Omit for all types.</param>
        /// <param name="subType">Sub-type filter within the chosen type; semantics depend on the type.</param>
